    // Therefore the reachable final sequences are exactly the nonnegative integer
    // vectors x_1..x_N such that:
    //   sum x_i = 3M
    //   0 <= x_i <= 2M
    //
    // Count solutions to sum x_i = 3M with upper bound 2M using inclusion-exclusion:
    //
